  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Programme de d&#xe9;veloppement du titre II.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vikina Resilience Food Security Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cnfa and its partners will implement the 5-year vikina resilience food security activity in southeastern Madagascar to deliver the graduation approach to households in selected districts of farafangana and vangaindrano. Once households are selected, cnfa will deliver the five components of the graduation approach to three different cohorts of participants,reaching a total of 34,000 households over the life of the activity.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Programme de d&#xe9;veloppement Titre II &#xe0; travers un partenaire de l&apos;Agence am&#xe9;ricaine pour le d&#xe9;veloppement international.</narrative>
  </description>
